{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14105200","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14105200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1410520001:1":{"text":"The ores flowing through these pipes look a lot like the echorites I use to grow mirage blooms...","source_cn":"管道中运输的这些矿石，和我用来培育幻影花的深岩晶好像……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98A8D5EDDD40FD82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410520002:1":{"text":"Were they always this iridescent...?","source_cn":"它们原本的光泽这么绚烂吗？像七彩的宝石……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x822406218EEC759C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410520003:1":{"text":"From what you mentioned before, the dwarves in Brimstone Village get their unique weapon materials from here, right?","source_cn":"根据你们之前告诉我的，深岩村的矮人用来制作特殊武器的原...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A3862AE59DD63C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410520004:1":{"text":"Could these be the raw echorites?","source_cn":"那么，提取机器上正在被粉碎加工的椭圆形矿石，莫非就是深...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x062C743BBBDCA66A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410520005:1":{"text":"No...","source_cn":"不对……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF423A208D91934C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410520006:1":{"text":"Huh? Are these not echorites?","source_cn":"祖娅，这不是深岩晶？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE340AB963BCD3DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410520007:1":{"text":"Oh, don't mind me, I'm just talking to myself!","source_cn":"啊，别理会我的自言自语！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5999C85B4112207C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410520008:1":{"text":"Yeah, these are echorites. If you and Mr. Pointy Ears could tell just by breathing the air, there's no way I'd make a mistake, right?","source_cn":"是，当然是。这就是你们和尖耳朵都认识的深岩晶！我当然不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEBBBA17C6072877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1410520008":{"text":"Yeah, these are echorites. If you and Mr. Pointy Ears could tell just by breathing the air, there's no way I'd make a mistake, right?","source_cn":"是，当然是。这就是你们和尖耳朵都认识的深岩晶！我当然不会看错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEBBBA17C6072877","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410520009:1":{"text":"Me? Strange? That's just my na